window.products.push({"id":475246,"name":"Shimomura Kogyo Made in Japan Verdun Santoku Knife 165mm Molybdenum Vanadium Steel Dishwasher compatible OVD-11 Niigata Tsubame Sanjo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ds71aKyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Due to the interchange period after the logo design has been renewed, the product may be delivered with the traditional logo design. \"Verdan Santoku Knife\" is made of clean all-stainless steel. Not only is it sharp, but the handle and blade seams are smooth so it can be easily cleaned by wiping away any dirt. Features: The blade is made of special knife steel (molybdenum vanadium steel) that is long-lasting in sharpness. The blade part is a hand-sharpened main blade. Excellent sharpness and attribute. The handle is a \"flowing form\" that fits your hand. The joint of the handle and blade is seamless, so it is easy to clean and hygienic. Can also be used with dishwashers. How to Use: (1) Stainless steel is not rust resistant metal, it is rust resistant. After use, wash thoroughly and dry before storage. Avoid storing in wet conditions or in humid areas. (2) Do not leave it in contact with other types of metals such as iron. (It will cause annoying rust). (3) Do not leave stains that contain salt or acid, etc. attached to the surface. (4) When rust occurs, apply cream cleanser to the sponge and rub it off gently. (5) Avoid using it to cut frozen foods or large fish bones. This may cause the blade to spill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ds71aKyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"下村工業(Shimomura Kougyou)","source_asin":"B0B8GZGQNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8GZGQNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8GZGQNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
