window.products.push({"id":475353,"name":"OvanMolnet Lavender Pillow, Supportive Bed Pillow for Neck Pain Relief, Comfortable Cervical Pillow Breathable Cooling Non-Pressure Pillow, TPE Grid P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vQjIUMK9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌜[Fast Rebound & Strong Support] The Lavender pillow is composed of hundreds of airy GelFlex grid, which makes it able to rebound in 0.15 seconds and keep its shape when you change sleep posture. It gives strong support to your head in all directions through countless support points to relieve the stress for your neck and shoulders, helping you get baby-like sleep 🛏️[Reliability] This OvanMolnet pillow is made of 100% TPE which is a new eco-friendly material with the characteristics of high strength and elasticity for longer service life. The surface of the upgraded material is smooth and skin-friendly without strange powder. It allows for continuous airflow through airy grids, so you can keep a cool head all night 🌕[Heavy & Stable] This cooling pillow weighs in about 9.2lb and adopts a one-piece injection molding process. Its heavy weight and large contact area will ensure the stability of the pillow which makes sure that your sleep is not interrupted when flipping and shifting during unconscious sleep, thus effectively prolonging your high-quality deep sleep time 🌙[Ergonomic Design] With two different heights, the Lavender pillow measures in 21.6”L x 12.6”W x 3.15”/4”H. The unique curved design seamlessly conform to the curvature of your neck. Ergonomic design meets various needs of the human body in different sleeping positions, especially cradle your head and neck, whether you are a stomach sleeper, side sleeper, back sleeper, or active sleeper 💤[Washable & All Year Available] The whole ergonomic pillow is machine washable and not easy to deform. We suggest you hand wash and air dry in the shade of a ventilated place to keep a longer service life. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us 🔴[Notes] This pillow is heavy and recommended for women and men who prefer Medium or Low height, so as to achieve the best deep sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vQjIUMK9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OvanMolnet","source_asin":"B0BTCXDTNT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCXDTNT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTCXDTNT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
