window.products.push({"id":475377,"name":"Professional Garlic Press - Stainless Steel Garlic Mincer - Mince & Crush Garlic Cloves & Ginger with Ease - Never Rust - Dishwasher Safe. Bonus: Garl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWPLkuifL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We all know that garlic smell is every cook's nightmare. After working with garlic who likes a smelly hand for the rest of the day? Garlic Mincer from JZ Quality Products promises, no more smelly hands . Pressing garlic will never be so fast and easy! No more peeling garlic , be a kitchen hero! Just insert the unpeeled garlic cloves of any size and give it a small squeeze, perfectly minced garlic pulp will be made instantly. It's easy as 1, 2, 3. you can squeeze the garlic cloves effortlessly. Very narrow basket seams prevent garlic spilling through or getting trapped when you press your garlic. We added extra bonus of garlic peeler so it will be much easier for you to peel and squeeze on the go. You will be surprised how easily you can produce your own fresh minced garlic. JZ Quality Products garlic masher is crafted using premium quality, food grade stainless steel for maximum safety and durability. JZ garlic mincer is guaranteed to never rust, peel off or fall apart. Also, it is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Handles open for easy skin-removal rinsing and cleaning. it is also a memorablegift that you can choose for your mom, wife or for any garlic lover. Use of high quality materials will ensure that your gift will be enjoyed a lifetime. We are not happy unless you get the best results. So, we will offer LIFETIME QUALITY WARRANTY for our Garlic Crusher. For any reason, if you aren't absolutely delighted with its material and craftsmanship, just return it and we will refund 100% of your outlay, no questions asked! Click on the \"ADD TO CART\" Button to order now and enjoy making healthy meals with your garlic squeezer and say bye bye to smelly hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWPLkuifL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOXHA","source_asin":"B01GQUMG0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GQUMG0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GQUMG0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
