window.products.push({"id":475444,"name":"Ecolunchbox Stainless Steel Food Storage Container Cube","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rfWqrssSL._AC_.jpg","description":"SQUARE STAINLESS STEEL BENTO: Built to last from 100% rugged and tested stainless steel, this bento measures 5.25 x 5.25 inches square by 2 inches deep. This versatile, go-to container holds 2.5 cups (21 oz). It's the perfect size for a small sandwich, cut fruit, leftovers or any other foods to-go that aren't too wet. NOT LEAK-PROOF: The container’s stainless steel lid is easy to use. There are no gaskets in this lunchbox’s design, so it’s not appropriate for packing wet foods that might leak. If you’re looking for a leak-proof food container, check out other products by ECOlunchbox, such as our Blue Water Bento Splash Box and Blue Water Bento Seal Cup Trio that have leak-proof silicone lids. 100% PLASTIC FREE, NON-BREAKABLE & BPA-FREE: Made from high-quality, food-safe stainless steel. Steel container is lighter than a comparable glass container and virtually non-breakable. ECOlunchbox stainless steel food containers, which are third party independently tested, are free of estrogen-mimicking toxins commonly found in plastic, such as BPA (bisphenol-A), BPS (bisphenol-S) and phthalates. DISHWASHER SAFE: All parts of our stainless steel bento boxes are dishwasher safe, including the lid! No need to hand wash lids separately from the container bases like with other brands with lids made from plastic or with embedded gunky gaskets. TRUSTED MISSION-BASED BRAND: California eco mom and environmentalist Sandra Ann Harris designed the original ECOlunchbox stainless steel food container more than 10 years ago to pack lunches for her family. The woman-owned company continues as a mission-based, family-owned business dedicated to helping people reduce their dependence on plastics for health and environmental reasons. We stand behind our products and offer a one-year limited warranty against manufacturer’s defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rfWqrssSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecolunchbox","source_asin":"B00EA07E3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EA07E3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EA07E3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
