window.products.push({"id":475560,"name":"TopAufell Portable Blender,Mini Blender for Shakes and Smoothies,Six Blades in 3D for Superb Mixing,Personal Size Blender with Powerful Motor 2000mAh ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71myHCFl+xS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our TopAufell portable blender is committed to providing customers with safe and healthy juice drinks. Product specifications: Color:WhiteBattery Capacity:2000mAhCup Weight:1.2lbTemperature:Below 60℃/140℉Blade Material:304 Stainless Steel,6 3D BladesMotor Sspeed:Idling:<22000RPM/Min;Load:<15000RPM/MinCup Size and Capacity:2.8 * 2.95 * 9inch/13ozNote:When the blender starts to work,it is best not to let the fruit get stuck on the blades.It is recommended that you shake the mini blender and stir thoroughly during the juice extraction process. 2000mAh Battery The personal blender has a built-in 2000 mAh rechargeable battery,which needs to be charged for 3-5 hours for the first use,and can be used for about 20 times. Easy to Use and Clean Put the cleaned fruit into the portable juicer bottle,pour water or milk to cover the blade,double-click the button,and wait for 20-30 seconds to reinstall the lid.The small blender can be easily cleaned by separating the main body and the bottom.Remember not to clean the bottom body. Before buying a portable blender,you can read the following tips: 1.Do not reach into the blender or touch the blade;2.Do not use the smoothie blender during charging,and do not run idling when there is nothing in the small blender; 3.Before using the blender cup for the first time,please charge it.When charging,the indicator light is red,after fully charged,the indicator light is blue;4.When squeezing juice,cut the fruit into small pieces,add water or milk to start mixing,you can add some small ice cubes in the USB blender,as long as there is enough liquid,the smoothies blender can operate normally;5.The indicator light of the handheld blender flashes between red and blue,it means the bottle is not aligned with the base,just align the arrow on the bottle with the switch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71myHCFl+xS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TopAufell","source_asin":"B09CGPL9TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CGPL9TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CGPL9TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
