window.products.push({"id":475696,"name":"ebos Premium muesli-to-go Cup Made of Bamboo | muesli Cup, muesli Bowl, Cereal Cup, Cereal Bowl, Yoghurt Cup, Travel beakers, incl. Spoon | Various De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181HOzxNoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fresh muesli on the go? With the stylish bamboo muesli-to-go cup plus bamboo spoon, enjoy breakfast at your desk in the office or at school or whilst riding the train to work or on a day's outing. The three-part muesli cup keeps the milk or yoghurt and the muesli in two separate containers. So the milk remains fresh and the cereal doesn't get soggy in the upper cup. This makes the muesli travel mug the perfect everyday item for anyone who needs to have their cereal in the morning. CLEVER: The three components of the compact Muesli container are attached to each other by screw closures with silicone seals that prevent leaks. The separator separates the two foodstuffs. The upper muesli cup can be filled with all kinds of delicious muesli, oat flakes, cereal, granola, fruit, or nuts. Cold or hot milk, yoghurt or other goodies can be put into the lower container. ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY: The stylish bamboo muesli cup and its spoon are made of bamboo fibres and corn starch. The cup sleeve is made of 100% natural wool felt. Bamboo is a fast-growing raw material and makes the Muesli-to-Go cup recyclable and reusable and thus an environmentally friendly choice. Help protect the environment by actively reducing waste. ROBUST / NICE LOOK: The rugged muesli to-go cup is long-lasting and dishwasher-safe and not only very pleasant and light to the touch, but also odourless and tasteless. Due to the environmental friendliness and the modern and beautiful designs, the high-quality muesli bamboo cup is a great gift idea that will make breakfast or a mid-morning snack a real pleasure. PRODUCT DETAIL: Milk or yoghurt capacity is 400 ml. The half-round muesli container offers 120 ml of space for about 40 grams of crispy muesli or about 70 grams of fresh fruit pieces. The 220 gram weight includes the upper chamber and handle ring. The reusable cup is about 16.5 cm high and the diameter is about 9 cm at the top (and about 6 cm at the base).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181HOzxNoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ebos","source_asin":"B07R16VG76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R16VG76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R16VG76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
