window.products.push({"id":475994,"name":"Window Film 3D Static Decoration Self Adhesive for Glass Sticker Window Film，Chinese Dragon Mythical，Sticker Removable 17.7\" W x 35.4\" L inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W9l96SFvL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Frosted Privacy Window Film, Enjoy The Privacy And Comfortable Light ! Give You Privacy Day And Night You will not see any shape on the other side unless maybe it was within 1 inch of the glass. Get A Ton Of Natural Light The frosted window film does not block out light, it also diffuses light well and can brighten a room. Perfect For Any Window Privacy Apply the privacy window film to your bathroom, kitchen, living room, office,etc. Enjoy comfortable privacy environment. Installation Instructions: Please follow the instructions to apply the privacy window film, it's the best way to do it. Step 1: Measure your window's size. Step 2: Measure and use scissors or razor blade to cut the film slightly larger than your window. Step 3: Clean your window. Make sure there isn't any kind of debris, dust or oil. Step 4: Spray the window with soapy water. Lots of soapy water is the key. Step 5: Remove the transparent film, smooth side to the window. Step 6: Apply the film against glass. Make sure the window with enough soapy water before applying it. Step 7: Squeegee out all bubbles, use old credit card or squeegee to smooth out bubbles. Step 8: Cut off excessive film, use a sharp knife to trim any edges. QUESTION & ANSWER: Q1: Any good way to smooth out the air bubbles? A1: Spraying a lot of soapy water is the key point, spray generously! Water makes it easier to smooth out the air bubbles. Q2: Is this frosted window film peel off easily? A4: Yes, this privacy window film is stick by static cling, no glue involved, just water and soap. You can remove it with no trace residue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W9l96SFvL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gacend","source_asin":"B087BS9ZYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-475994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087BS9ZYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087BS9ZYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
